SAND MANIPULATION -- GRADED EXERCISE PROGRESSION
For candidates with verified sand or gold-dust affinity ONLY.

Sand control is not taught broadly; the great majority of Sunagakure shinobi
never wield it. This progression is reserved for the rare candidate whose
chakra can bind particulate matter.

Level 1 -- Cohesion: Hold a handful of sand aloft and maintain its shape for
one minute without spillage. Trains fine, sustained chakra emission.
Level 2 -- Shaping: Form the suspended sand into a disc, then a spear, then a
wall on command. Speed and precision are scored.
Level 3 -- Automatic defense: Condition the sand to intercept a thrown senbon
without conscious direction (the principle behind the Sand Shield).
Level 4 -- Mass and binding: Envelop a training post and compress. Supervised
only; power is capped to prevent injury.

Caution: The Fifth Kazekage's mastery is the standard, not the expectation. No
candidate is to emulate bijuu-scale techniques. Fatigue and chakra exhaustion
are the chief risks -- rest is enforced between sessions.
